se derivative of a formal Laurent expansion:\n`(Σ c_e tᵉ)' = Σ (e+1)·c_{e+1} tᵉ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.FormalLaurentResidue.fresidue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.FormalLaurentResidue.fresidue","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/FormalLaurentResidue.lean#L40-L42","doc":"Formal residue of a local Laurent expansion, presented as its coefficient\nfunction `f : ℤ → R`: the coefficient of `t⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}